# =============================================================================
# Privacy first: NEVER commit training photos, personal data, or secrets.
# This repository ships only CODE and the trained MODEL WEIGHTS — never images
# or annotations. (See README / MODEL_CARD for why.)
# =============================================================================

# ---- Images / photos (training & source data must stay out) ----
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.bmp
*.tiff
*.webp
*.svg
*.ico
*.heic
*.heif

# ---- Datasets, raw exports, annotations, run artifacts ----
raw/
data/
dataset/
dataset_*/
crops_*/
aug/
runs/
_old*/
*.zip
docs/

# ---- Toolkit generated fixtures + local presence/GT files (never commit data) ----
toolkit/tests/_fixtures/
*_kombiniert.json
*_gt.txt
*_boxes.json
*_bbx_gt.txt
*.tar
*.tar.gz
annotations*.json
*_coco.json

# ---- Secrets / credentials / server access ----
# NOTE: the repo-root `.env` is intentionally NOT ignored — it holds release
# METADATA only (model size, tiles, classes, metrics) and is committed.
# Never put real secrets/tokens in it.
*.key
*.pem
*.token
**/serviceAccountKey.json
source/FireBase/serviceAccountKey.json
*export*link*.txt
*tunnel*
toolkit/recovery/windows/recovery.json
toolkit/recovery/windows/*.log

# ---- Editor / IDE ----
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
.hiden/

# ---- Python ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
venv/
.venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---- OS junk ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---- Legacy pre-toolkit scripts/notebooks (superseded by toolkit/, hardcode
# the personal JupyterHub path/student id) + internal scratch notes ----
scripts/
notebooks/
data_prep_pipeline.py
start_training.py
task_progress.md

# =============================================================================
# The only things this repo publishes besides code: .env (release metadata),
# MODEL_CARD.md (public model documentation), and models/ (trained weights).
# Everything else private/business-specific stays out per the rules above.
# =============================================================================

# ---- Allow the trained model weights (tracked via Git LFS, see .gitattributes) ----
!models/
!models/**

# ---- Allow the one generated chart (accuracy across releases, no source photos) ----
!metrics/accuracy_history.png
